{"id":"6fe48e4cc479f3fd","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-space-hierarchy.md","title":"Deterministic Space Hierarchy","display":"thm-space-hierarchy — Deterministic Space Hierarchy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-space-hierarchy","aliases":["28-thm-space-hierarchy","Deterministic Space Hierarchy Theorem"],"display":"thm-space-hierarchy — Deterministic Space Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[28-df-space-constructible]]","[[28-df-dspace]]"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-space-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-space-hierarchy</span><span>Deterministic Space Hierarchy Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-space-hierarchy — Deterministic Space Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"af1247ecca733ff0\" href=\"?note=af1247ecca733ff0\" title=\"28-df-space-constructible\">28-df-space-constructible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4382c6bdd7033833\" href=\"?note=4382c6bdd7033833\" title=\"28-df-dspace\">28-df-dspace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 均为空间可构造函数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"af1247ecca733ff0\" href=\"?note=af1247ecca733ff0\" title=\"28-df-space-constructible\">28-df-space-constructible</a>；对充分大的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n),g(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\">\\(f(n),g(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{DSPACE}\\)</span> 采用只计工作带并容许常数因子的约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{f(n)}{g(n)}=0\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{DSPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{f(n)}{g(n)}=0\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{DSPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空间通用模拟只产生常数因子开销，故不需要时间层级中的对数损失；可通过空间时钟和配置计数使模拟停机后翻转答案。原书将一般证明留作习题4.1，本次核对陈述与该证明指引，未声称原书给出完整证明。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理4.8及其后说明；印刷82–83页；PDF108–109页。陈述已核对，证明留作习题4.1。</p>\n<p>R6证据边界：一般空间对角化证明在原书留作习题，当前只保留证明梗概。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-space-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"af1247ecca733ff0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-space-constructible]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-dspace","status":"resolved","id":"4382c6bdd7033833","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-dspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-space-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"af1247ecca733ff0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 均为空间可构造函数，见 [[28-df-space-constructible]]；对充分大的 $n$ 有 $f(n),g(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"f(n),g(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{f(n)}{g(n)}=0\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{DSPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DSPACE}(g).","display":true}],"bytes":1434,"backlinks":[{"id":"c36828ce471a79d1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf L,\\mathbf{PSPACE}$ 见所列定义；空间层级定理采用 [[28-thm-space-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"层次结论：[[28-thm-time-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-space-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-p-neq-exp]]、[[28-thm-savitch]]、[[28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace]]、[[28-thm-immersman-szelepcsényi]]。"}],"outgoing":["af1247ecca733ff0","4382c6bdd7033833"]}